('advanced-native-604', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-604-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The layout allowed space to pause apart from the queue, not extra opening time."],"options":["The venue extended its opening hours so visitors had longer to decide when to come.","The racks were moved into the doorway to bring the queue closer to the map.","The change was an air-quality test rather than a rearrangement of the room.","The layout allowed space to pause apart from the queue, not extra opening time."]},"advanced-native-604-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["A separate stopping space would help the entrance stay clear.","We wanted room for reading the map as well as a route for people arriving.","It gave visitors breathing room to pause by the map without blocking the incoming queue.","The old layout made people stop in the same narrow place where others were entering."],"options":["A separate stopping space would help the entrance stay clear.","We wanted room for reading the map as well as a route for people arriving.","It gave visitors breathing room to pause by the map without blocking the incoming queue.","The old layout made people stop in the same narrow place where others were entering."]},"advanced-native-604-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The wider spacing gives people breathing room without changing the time set for the photograph."],"options":["The wider spacing gives people breathing room without changing the time set for the photograph.","The instruction extends the booking time but leaves everyone standing just as close.","The photographer asks everyone to form a tighter line rather than leave wider gaps for the photograph."]},"advanced-native-604-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["A later deadline gives someone more time to think without changing their surroundings."],"options":["A wider gap lets people move without pressing against one another.","A later deadline gives someone more time to think without changing their surroundings.","A clear area beside a queue allows someone to stop briefly."]},"advanced-native-604-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["No, it gives visitors breathing room beside the map; the opening hours are the same."],"options":["We have not moved the racks yet; visitors are still being asked to stop in the incoming queue.","No, it gives visitors breathing room beside the map; the opening hours are the same.","Yes, moving the racks has added an hour to the venue’s opening schedule."]},"advanced-native-604-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Staggering the six dancers would give them breathing room to turn without brushing against one another. Could we try it slowly before deciding whether the new spacing works for the whole sequence?","We need breathing room for the turns, not fewer dancers or a longer piece. Let us offset the two rows and check the movement slowly before bringing it up to performance pace."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-605', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-605-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The cards were used up, then a borrowed pack allowed the labels to be completed."],"options":["The cards were used up, then a borrowed pack allowed the labels to be completed.","The team only predicted a possible shortage and still had enough cards for everyone throughout.","The borrowed pack had already arrived before the workshop began.","The team continued the label activity without cards and never obtained another supply."]},"advanced-native-605-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The material needed for the next step had been used up.","We had run out of blank cards and needed another pack before people could finish their labels.","There were no cards left for the label work at that point.","We needed to wait for the borrowed supply rather than leave some labels unfinished."],"options":["The material needed for the next step had been used up.","We had run out of blank cards and needed another pack before people could finish their labels.","There were no cards left for the label work at that point.","We needed to wait for the borrowed supply rather than leave some labels unfinished."]},"advanced-native-605-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["We may run out of tape in a later session, but we have not run out yet."],"options":["The replacement delivery has already restored a full supply for every later session.","We may run out of tape in a later session, but we have not run out yet.","We have already run out of tape, with none left for the next session."]},"advanced-native-605-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["Some supply remains, although it may not cover a later task."],"options":["A replacement may be needed before work using that material continues.","The available supply has been used and none remains.","Some supply remains, although it may not cover a later task."]},"advanced-native-605-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Not yet. We have run out of flour for another batch, so let us check a new supply before promising it."],"options":["Yes, there is still flour left in the same supply, so we can start immediately.","Accept the extra batch now; we can find out tomorrow whether the ingredients are available.","Not yet. We have run out of flour for another batch, so let us check a new supply before promising it."]},"advanced-native-605-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["We may run out of flour if we double the recipe, since I have only set aside enough for one batch. Could we check the cupboard before promising an extra tray?","I have not run out of flour, but I do not yet know whether there is enough for twice the mixture. Let us count what is left and agree on the extra baking after that."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-606', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-606-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The proposal added height over the workshop, while the use of the extra level remained undecided."],"options":["The model removed the workshop and replaced it with an open courtyard.","The proposal added height over the workshop, while the use of the extra level remained undecided.","The team extended the workshop across the courtyard without adding a level.","The drawing confirmed the new floor had already been assigned to a particular group."]},"advanced-native-606-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["We chose to build upward by adding a level above the existing workshop.","The courtyard remains outside the extension shown in the drawing.","The added space is placed over the workshop rather than beside it.","The model changes the height while keeping the workshop’s ground footprint."],"options":["We chose to build upward by adding a level above the existing workshop.","The courtyard remains outside the extension shown in the drawing.","The added space is placed over the workshop rather than beside it.","The model changes the height while keeping the workshop’s ground footprint."]},"advanced-native-606-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The drawing shows a wider footprint rather than building upward, since the height stays the same."],"options":["The drawing keeps both the height and ground footprint unchanged.","The drawing shows a wider footprint rather than building upward, since the height stays the same.","The unchanged height means that an extra floor has been added above the houses."]},"advanced-native-606-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["The plan is already suitable for every resident and approved for construction."],"options":["A drawing may show what is placed above the current structure.","The planned development adds height rather than only spreading over more ground.","The plan is already suitable for every resident and approved for construction."]},"advanced-native-606-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["No. We have built upward, but the extra level’s use is still undecided; we should ask before calling it a gallery."],"options":["Yes, the extra height confirms that the new level is already being used for public exhibitions.","There is no extra level; the change only made the existing ground floor wider.","No. We have built upward, but the extra level’s use is still undecided; we should ask before calling it a gallery."]},"advanced-native-606-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["These models compare spreading outward with choosing to build upward on a smaller base. Look at where the extra space goes, then ask how people would enter and use each level rather than assume that taller means better.","One version builds upward, while the other uses a wider base at a lower height. The comparison invites questions about use and access, not a verdict that one direction solves every need."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-607', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-607-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The speaker has begun and made a first bowl, without settling a regular schedule."],"options":["The speaker made the first bowl before attending the session suggested by the friend.","The speaker has already set a three-class weekly routine and committed to the full term.","The speaker has begun and made a first bowl, without settling a regular schedule.","The speaker has only considered an invitation and has not attended any session."]},"advanced-native-607-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["A friend’s invitation led me to try my first class.","I began with an introductory session rather than a regular commitment.","My first attempt came from joining the session my friend suggested.","I took up pottery after a friend invited me to a beginners’ session."],"options":["A friend’s invitation led me to try my first class.","I began with an introductory session rather than a regular commitment.","My first attempt came from joining the session my friend suggested.","I took up pottery after a friend invited me to a beginners’ session."]},"advanced-native-607-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["She plans to take up birdwatching next month, but has not started the introductory activity yet."],"options":["Her plan concerns only borrowing equipment, and she has decided not to try birdwatching.","She plans to take up birdwatching next month, but has not started the introductory activity yet.","She has already joined the introductory outing, although her longer schedule is undecided."]},"advanced-native-607-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["A large table occupies most of the available floor space."],"options":["A large table occupies most of the available floor space.","Start doing an activity that one had not previously pursued.","Begin learning an instrument as a new interest."]},"advanced-native-607-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["No, I have taken up pottery by starting the class; I am still a beginner and have not decided how often to continue."],"options":["No, I have taken up pottery by starting the class; I am still a beginner and have not decided how often to continue.","Yes, taken up means I have already reached an expert level after years of practice.","No, it means I have only considered a class and have not attended one yet."]},"advanced-native-607-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["I have only just taken up the harmonica, so I could share a short part I have learnt rather than perform a full piece. Please keep it informal instead of putting it on the programme as a prepared performance.","I took up the harmonica last week and would enjoy showing you a small beginning. I am not ready for a long solo, but I can let the family hear the bit I know without making it a formal item."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-608', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-608-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Two uses share a smaller plot, while the timing between them remains to be agreed."],"options":["The model gives each use a larger separate plot, with no shared ground.","Both uses have already been scheduled for every same moment without any conflict.","The team has removed the performance use and kept seating as the only activity.","Two uses share a smaller plot, while the timing between them remains to be agreed."]},"advanced-native-608-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The plan combines the intended uses in one space, rather than requiring a separate site for each.","The smaller shared footprint still includes both intended activities.","It folds more functions into less land by letting performance and lunchtime seating share one plot.","The two activities no longer each need a separate area in this version."],"options":["The plan combines the intended uses in one space, rather than requiring a separate site for each.","The smaller shared footprint still includes both intended activities.","It folds more functions into less land by letting performance and lunchtime seating share one plot.","The two activities no longer each need a separate area in this version."]},"advanced-native-608-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["This version does not show folding more function into less land; it separates the uses onto larger plots."],"options":["The larger separate plots are evidence that the same ground is being shared more intensively.","The reading use has been removed entirely and no longer appears in the design.","This version does not show folding more function into less land; it separates the uses onto larger plots."]},"advanced-native-608-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["Every use is now conflict-free and equally convenient for all participants."],"options":["Several uses are combined within a smaller ground area.","Every use is now conflict-free and equally convenient for all participants.","The account should explain the proposed sharing arrangement."]},"advanced-native-608-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Folding more function into less land still needs an agreed timetable; let us ask both groups before confirming how they will share it."],"options":["Yes, including both uses in the drawing means their simultaneous use has already been agreed.","The drawing shows two separate sites, so the groups do not need to consider sharing a plot.","Folding more function into less land still needs an agreed timetable; let us ask both groups before confirming how they will share it."]},"advanced-native-608-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["The design may fold more functions into less land, but the two drawings use different scales. Could you give the actual plot areas in the same units before we make that comparison?","I can see the added uses, but I cannot yet confirm the claim about folding more function into less land from these pictures. Please add comparable area figures rather than use the size of the drawing as the ground area."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-609', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-609-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The report treated capacity as sufficient and omitted lived needs that the critic wanted included."],"options":["The report treated capacity as sufficient and omitted lived needs that the critic wanted included.","The critic wanted to remove all housing rather than consider how people would live there.","The report had already compared meeting places and different residents’ daily routines.","The critic’s main concern was that the bed count was too low, rather than the report leaving out daily needs."]},"advanced-native-609-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["She wanted the model to include residents’ needs as well as the number accommodated.","It looked like a machine for fitting people in because bed numbers were counted without considering daily life.","The account left out where people would meet and how their routines would work.","Capacity figures were being used as if they told the whole story of living there."],"options":["She wanted the model to include residents’ needs as well as the number accommodated.","It looked like a machine for fitting people in because bed numbers were counted without considering daily life.","The account left out where people would meet and how their routines would work.","Capacity figures were being used as if they told the whole story of living there."]},"advanced-native-609-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The design does more than act as a machine for fitting people in, because it also responds to residents’ routines and shared spaces."],"options":["The described process stopped after counting places and never asked residents about their needs.","The design does more than act as a machine for fitting people in, because it also responds to residents’ routines and shared spaces.","The interviews were used only to calculate bed numbers, without changing shared spaces or quiet times."]},"advanced-native-609-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["Providing homes is itself wrong, regardless of how residents’ needs are considered."],"options":["Providing homes is itself wrong, regardless of how residents’ needs are considered.","The criticism should identify what human needs the plan leaves out.","The speaker thinks capacity has been prioritised over lived experience."]},"advanced-native-609-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["We need more than a machine for fitting people in; let us ask where meetings and everyday routines would take place."],"options":["You are asking for the housing to be cancelled rather than for a place to meet.","We need more than a machine for fitting people in; let us ask where meetings and everyday routines would take place.","The bed total already tells us how daily meetings will work, so that question has been answered."]},"advanced-native-609-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["When I called the plan a machine for fitting people in, I meant its narrow measure of success, not the people who live there. Please keep the residents’ accounts of caring for one another rather than turn my criticism into a judgement of them.","My concern about a machine for fitting people in is directed at the report’s focus on capacity. The neighbours’ support for one another belongs in the article and should not be replaced by a claim that they lack warmth."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-610', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-610-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Taller buildings and lost familiar greetings shaped her feeling, without establishing what the new residents are like."],"options":["Taller buildings and lost familiar greetings shaped her feeling, without establishing what the new residents are like.","She had interviewed the new residents and confirmed that none wanted neighbourly contact.","The street’s buildings became lower, while the old café continued its daily greetings.","The account compared measured room temperatures before and after rebuilding."]},"advanced-native-610-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["She was describing a personal loss of familiar connection, not a measured change in temperature.","It had gained height but lost warmth for her because the café’s familiar greetings were gone.","The taller blocks replaced a place where she used to meet people every day.","Her memory of everyday contact made the closed café matter beyond its building size."],"options":["She was describing a personal loss of familiar connection, not a measured change in temperature.","It had gained height but lost warmth for her because the café’s familiar greetings were gone.","The taller blocks replaced a place where she used to meet people every day.","Her memory of everyday contact made the closed café matter beyond its building size."]},"advanced-native-610-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The extra height does not by itself show that the block has gained height but lost warmth; the shared activity suggests continuing connection."],"options":["The account reports an untested invitation to garden, rather than residents already taking turns.","The extra height does not by itself show that the block has gained height but lost warmth; the shared activity suggests continuing connection.","The warm connection described belongs to former residents before the taller block opened."]},"advanced-native-610-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["Every tall building necessarily makes its residents unfriendly."],"options":["The loss of warmth should be grounded in specific experience or interaction.","A writer contrasts taller buildings with a felt loss of human connection.","Every tall building necessarily makes its residents unfriendly."]},"advanced-native-610-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["No. The street has gained height but lost warmth in my experience because I miss those greetings; I have not yet met the new residents."],"options":["Yes, I can judge the new residents’ attitudes from the height without meeting them.","The café still opens every day, so the account is about its unchanged routine rather than anything I miss.","No. The street has gained height but lost warmth in my experience because I miss those greetings; I have not yet met the new residents."]},"advanced-native-610-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Whether the area will gain height but lose warmth is a question we can explore, not a conclusion established by these pictures. Could we ask former customers and new residents about their everyday contact before writing the comparison as fact?","The draft’s claim that the area has gained height but lost warmth needs accounts of social life, not only a height diagram. Let us collect both older memories and present experiences without deciding in advance that they must point the same way."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-611', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-611-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Each format was checked for how it would introduce unfamiliar terms, alongside time and cost."],"options":["The group chose only the cheapest format without examining new readers’ needs.","The goal had already been achieved for every reader before the proposals were discussed.","The need was mentioned only after the chosen format had been finalised.","Each format was checked for how it would introduce unfamiliar terms, alongside time and cost."]},"advanced-native-611-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["We needed to compare that part of each format before choosing one.","The requirement connected our stated purpose to the practical options we were judging.","We wanted to keep new readers’ access firmly in view rather than treat it as an opening slogan.","The way unfamiliar terms are introduced affects whether a newcomer can follow the discussion."],"options":["We needed to compare that part of each format before choosing one.","The requirement connected our stated purpose to the practical options we were judging.","We wanted to keep new readers’ access firmly in view rather than treat it as an opening slogan.","The way unfamiliar terms are introduced affects whether a newcomer can follow the discussion."]},"advanced-native-611-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The purpose is stated, but we have not yet shown that beginners’ understanding is kept firmly in view during the choice."],"options":["The purpose is stated, but we have not yet shown that beginners’ understanding is kept firmly in view during the choice.","The cover statement confirms that every later choice has already been checked with beginners.","The team has already tested the explanations and chosen the clearest version."]},"advanced-native-611-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["The goal has already been achieved and no checking remains."],"options":["Explain how a choice relates to the goal.","Use the goal as an ongoing consideration.","The goal has already been achieved and no checking remains."]},"advanced-native-611-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Keep access firmly in view by comparing the term explanations as well as cost before deciding."],"options":["Rank the formats by how many unfamiliar terms they list, without checking how the terms are introduced.","Keep access firmly in view by comparing the term explanations as well as cost before deciding.","Choose by price now and decide how to introduce terms only after the first discussion ends."]},"advanced-native-611-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["I want to keep the question of admitting the mistake firmly in view as I revise the ending. I will compare what a chase and a conversation let the character choose before deciding which belongs in the chapter.","With the character’s responsibility firmly in view, I would ask what the proposed chase adds to his decision. It may belong in the ending, but excitement alone is not the reason I am looking for."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-612', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-612-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The same group used different positions, with a planned return to compare views."],"options":["The group finished after sketching separately, with no planned return to compare the drawings.","Everyone stayed at the bench and drew exactly the same view for the whole session.","The same group used different positions, with a planned return to compare views.","Six new people joined, doubling the group before anyone sketched."]},"advanced-native-612-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["Different positions could reveal parts of the courtyard one seat would miss.","We wanted a range of viewpoints from the same six people.","The later comparison would be more useful if we had not all stood together.","We spread out so each person could sketch a different view before comparing the drawings."],"options":["Different positions could reveal parts of the courtyard one seat would miss.","We wanted a range of viewpoints from the same six people.","The later comparison would be more useful if we had not all stood together.","We spread out so each person could sketch a different view before comparing the drawings."]},"advanced-native-612-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The photographs are spread out over two walls, though the number and theme remain the same."],"options":["Spreading them out has added ten new photographs to the collection.","The two walls now present unrelated exhibitions with no shared theme.","The photographs are spread out over two walls, though the number and theme remain the same."]},"advanced-native-612-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["The total number must have increased."],"options":["The account can explain where the separate positions are.","People or things occupy a wider area.","The total number must have increased."]},"advanced-native-612-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["No, we spread out for different views and will meet again after fifteen minutes to compare the sketches."],"options":["Yes, spreading out means we have ended the group and will not compare the drawings.","We stayed together at the starting point, so nobody tried a separate viewpoint.","No, we spread out for different views and will meet again after fifteen minutes to compare the sketches."]},"advanced-native-612-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Let the six characters spread out slowly while keeping one shared gesture that answers across the stage. They can remain in the scene, showing separate thoughts without turning the movement into a final departure.","As they spread out, each character could pause in a different place and still respond to the others’ hands. I would end with all six present rather than suggest that the group has broken apart."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
