problem.","The response is large, without knowing what need it must address.","A much smaller tested response meets the same limited need."]},"advanced-native-614-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The rebuild may be overkill, but the name still needs a correction and a check of the message."],"options":["Leave the confirmation unchanged and treat every small error as acceptable.","Begin the rebuild before checking whether the targeted correction works.","The rebuild may be overkill, but the name still needs a correction and a check of the message."]},"advanced-native-614-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Thank you for offering, but a colour booklet may be overkill for this small gathering. One clear message with the time and entrance would be enough; could you help check whether the directions make sense?","I appreciate the thought, though a full programme feels like overkill when only two neighbours need the arrival details. I would welcome your help with a short, clear set of directions instead."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
