ting is known.","A tone interrupts the task the particular instructions must serve.","The judgement explains what about the setting makes the item unsuitable."]},"advanced-native-615-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The caption was out of place in the instruction panel; let us consider the activities page on its own purpose."],"options":["Keep the joke in the practical directions and remove the step it interrupted.","The caption was out of place in the instruction panel; let us consider the activities page on its own purpose.","Apply the instruction panel’s tone to every page without checking what each one is for."]},"advanced-native-615-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["The legal-sounding sentence feels out of place among the warm, specific thanks in the rest of the letter. Could you keep the point you want to make and say it in the same natural voice as the other paragraphs?","One copied phrase looks out of place here, rather than the whole letter being unsuitable. I would keep the personal examples and replace that line with words you would actually use when thanking your tutor."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
