ut I would still like to see you later if that works for you."],"options":["I need a quiet hour to recharge first, but I would still like to see you later if that works for you.","Your preference for a lively break means I have already agreed to join the immediate gathering.","I would prefer the immediate gathering after all; I no longer want the quiet hour I mentioned."]},"advanced-native-640-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Watching clips through lunch did not help me recharge; I returned to the model feeling more tired. Tomorrow I will try ten minutes away from screens and notice how I feel afterwards.","I expected the videos to help me recharge, but this break left me less ready to work. I will test a short screen-free pause tomorrow rather than assume that the same kind of rest suits everyone."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-641', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-641-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["She wanted space for neighbourly activity alongside clear routes, not instead of all movement."],"options":["She wanted space for neighbourly activity alongside clear routes, not instead of all movement.","She asked to widen the routes by replacing the proposed gathering space with extra traffic lanes.","The plan already included the weekly meeting place she requested.","The resident asked to move the exchange to an existing indoor room already included in the plan."]},"advanced-native-641-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["She wanted the design to support meeting as well as moving through the area.","It needed a heartbeat rather than just a traffic system because the neighbours’ weekly exchange had no place in the plan.","The routes solved movement but did not say where people could gather for the shared activity.","Her concern was the missing everyday connection, alongside paths that still needed to stay clear."],"options":["She wanted the design to support meeting as well as moving through the area.","It needed a heartbeat rather than just a traffic system because the neighbours’ weekly exchange had no place in the plan.","The routes solved movement but did not say where people could gather for the shared activity.","Her concern was the missing everyday connection, alongside paths that still needed to stay clear."]},"advanced-native-641-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["A heartbeat rather than just a traffic system can include shared life and usable routes together."],"options":["The shared seats establish that no one needs the clear path any longer.","The account says all gathering places were removed to add more lanes.","A heartbeat rather than just a traffic system can include shared life and usable routes together."]},"advanced-native-641-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["Every transport route must be removed for community life to exist."],"options":["Human connection should be considered beyond transport alone.","Every transport route must be removed for community life to exist.","The claim needs concrete examples of the life it wants to support."]},"advanced-native-641-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["I want a heartbeat rather than just a traffic system, with a meeting place beside a path that stays usable."],"options":["The route diagram already explains where the weekly story exchange can meet.","I want a heartbeat rather than just a traffic system, with a meeting place beside a path that stays usable.","Yes, gathering can only begin after that route is removed."]},"advanced-native-641-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["The city needs a heartbeat rather than just a traffic system, and these residents have not all experienced the changes in the same way. Better routes matter, but we must also ask what has happened to the places where people recognise and support one another.","A heartbeat rather than just a traffic system means listening to the memories of lost meeting places alongside the value of new routes. The road opening is a beginning for these questions, not a conclusion that every resident’s needs have been met."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-642', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-642-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["She missed a familiar social routine while still valuing books and recognising other visitors’ enjoyment."],"options":["Mina said the reading corner was still meeting every week as before.","She missed a familiar social routine while still valuing books and recognising other visitors’ enjoyment.","She no longer liked the books and wanted to replace reading with a different kind of activity.","All visitors reported that quiet reading had lost its value."]},"advanced-native-642-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["It felt dull and grey around the edges to her because the familiar weekly greetings had gone.","Closing the reading corner removed a routine through which she knew people.","She still loved the books but missed the connection that had accompanied those visits.","The weekly chance to greet familiar people disappeared when that corner closed."],"options":["It felt dull and grey around the edges to her because the familiar weekly greetings had gone.","Closing the reading corner removed a routine through which she knew people.","She still loved the books but missed the connection that had accompanied those visits.","The weekly chance to greet familiar people disappeared when that corner closed."]},"advanced-native-642-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Grey walls alone do not establish that the town feels dull and grey around the edges to its residents."],"options":["The town’s grey paint is the main evidence for the emotional description, regardless of the neighbours’ interactions.","The account describes residents saying they feel isolated instead of helping one another.","Grey walls alone do not establish that the town feels dull and grey around the edges to its residents."]},"advanced-native-642-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["Every surface is literally painted grey and every resident feels the same."],"options":["The speaker experiences a loss of liveliness or warmth.","Every surface is literally painted grey and every resident feels the same.","Some valued experiences may remain beside the feeling of loss."]},"advanced-native-642-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["It feels dull and grey around the edges because I miss those greetings, even though the books still matter to me."],"options":["I mean that every visitor has stopped enjoying quiet reading, not that I miss a particular routine.","It feels dull and grey around the edges because I miss those greetings, even though the books still matter to me.","I miss the reading corner mainly because it was a convenient place to store my books, rather than because of the greetings."]},"advanced-native-642-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Life feels dull and grey around the edges without our chance meetings in the corridor, even though my new routine is working. Could we find a short time to talk that suits us both, without expecting one call to bring everything back?","Things are going well in some ways, but they feel dull and grey around the edges when I miss our everyday greetings. I would like to arrange one brief call first and hear how your new days are going too."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-643', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-643-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Cost and quiet favoured the room, while carrying chairs remained a drawback to discuss with members."],"options":["Every member had already approved before the group examined the room.","The room required a fee and offered no quiet place to read.","Cost and quiet favoured the room, while carrying chairs remained a drawback to discuss with members.","Calling it favourable meant no practical drawback remained to consider."]},"advanced-native-643-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["They valued the low cost and quiet enough to discuss how the extra work could be shared.","The room met important reading needs, though the practical effort still had to be acceptable.","Their judgement balanced a useful setting against an inconvenience rather than ignoring it.","For them, the benefits outweighed the drawbacks because a free, quiet room served their purpose despite the chair-carrying."],"options":["They valued the low cost and quiet enough to discuss how the extra work could be shared.","The room met important reading needs, though the practical effort still had to be acceptable.","Their judgement balanced a useful setting against an inconvenience rather than ignoring it.","For them, the benefits outweighed the drawbacks because a free, quiet room served their purpose despite the chair-carrying."]},"advanced-native-643-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The benefits may outweigh the drawbacks for some members, but this access need must still be addressed before a shared decision."],"options":["The majority’s preference establishes that the other member can already use the upstairs room.","The account says an alternative entrance has already been checked and agreed.","The benefits may outweigh the drawbacks for some members, but this access need must still be addressed before a shared decision."]},"advanced-native-643-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["Count positive points and ignore a single decisive access problem."],"options":["Acknowledge disadvantages even when choosing the option.","Compare the importance of gains and costs for the stated purpose.","Count positive points and ignore a single decisive access problem."]},"advanced-native-643-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The benefits outweigh the drawbacks for our purpose, but we still need to ask whether the practical arrangement works for everyone affected."],"options":["Yes, our preference already confirms that every member can use the upstairs room.","The carrying requirement has already been removed, so there is no remaining arrangement to discuss.","The benefits outweigh the drawbacks for our purpose, but we still need to ask whether the practical arrangement works for everyone affected."]},"advanced-native-643-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["I think the benefits outweigh the drawbacks of shortening the opening, provided we move the grandmother’s memory to a later scene rather than lose it. Let us try that version with a reader before deciding whether the quicker start still carries the story’s warmth.","For this draft, the benefits outweigh the drawbacks if the shorter opening brings the conflict forward and the memory survives elsewhere. I would test that balance rather than claim the cut has removed every problem."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-644', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-644-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Clearer feedback was the goal, with practice begun but no promised or offered new role."],"options":["The course had already guaranteed her appointment as the publication’s editor.","She refused to work with colleagues because progress required competing alone.","She was preparing to teach the editing course, rather than taking it to develop her feedback.","Clearer feedback was the goal, with practice begun but no promised or offered new role."]},"advanced-native-644-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The course addressed the kind of editing work she wanted to develop.","She saw clearer feedback as a useful step towards her longer-term publishing goal.","She hoped to get ahead in community publishing by learning to give clearer feedback.","She wanted a skill that could improve how she contributed to the publication."],"options":["The course addressed the kind of editing work she wanted to develop.","She saw clearer feedback as a useful step towards her longer-term publishing goal.","She hoped to get ahead in community publishing by learning to give clearer feedback.","She wanted a skill that could improve how she contributed to the publication."]},"advanced-native-644-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["She can get ahead in her work while learning with a colleague; collaboration does not erase her development."],"options":["Learning together establishes that she has gained no editing skill herself.","The account says she completed the task alone without discussing the quotations.","She can get ahead in her work while learning with a colleague; collaboration does not erase her development."]},"advanced-native-644-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["A particular appointment or promotion is guaranteed."],"options":["Make progress in a stated area.","A particular appointment or promotion is guaranteed.","Support from others may be part of the process."]},"advanced-nat