('advanced-native-645', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-645-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Practice could support a clearer explanation, while selection and the sample requirement remained separate."],"options":["Practice could support a clearer explanation, while selection and the sample requirement remained separate.","Practice had already secured the place and removed the need for a sample.","The interviewers had confirmed the final list before he practised.","He had already delivered the required sample and was waiting only for the final announcement."]},"advanced-native-645-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The preparation addressed the part of the interview that depended on his own presentation.","It gave him a better shot at explaining the project clearly when he was asked about it.","Rehearsing helped him organise what he wanted to say within the short time.","He wanted to make the explanation easier to follow, not assume selection was already settled."],"options":["The preparation addressed the part of the interview that depended on his own presentation.","It gave him a better shot at explaining the project clearly when he was asked about it.","Rehearsing helped him organise what he wanted to say within the short time.","He wanted to make the explanation easier to follow, not assume selection was already settled."]},"advanced-native-645-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["She has been selected, which is a firmer result than simply having a better shot at a place."],"options":["The account says she has not yet received any reply about selection.","She has been selected, which is a firmer result than simply having a better shot at a place.","Her notification says only that preparation may improve her chance, without giving a decision."]},"advanced-native-645-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["The outcome has already been guaranteed."],"options":["Other requirements may still need to be met.","A greater chance relative to some relevant comparison.","The outcome has already been guaranteed."]},"advanced-native-645-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Yes. Practice gives you a better shot at a clear explanation, but the sample requirement still applies."],"options":["No, improving the explanation automatically counts as permission to omit the sample.","You have already been selected, so the interview and every requirement are finished.","Yes. Practice gives you a better shot at a clear explanation, but the sample requirement still applies."]},"advanced-native-645-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Putting the forms and clear instructions in the library would give people outside the hall a better shot at applying. They would still need to submit their stories, and selection would remain open.","Let us make the application details available in the library so that people who missed the hall meeting have a better shot at taking part. Wider access would support an application, not promise a place."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-646', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-646-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The visitor’s reduced commitments felt slower, without describing the aunt’s two-job routine."],"options":["The visitor had recorded the aunt’s full working year before comparing their days.","The visitor’s reduced commitments felt slower, without describing the aunt’s two-job routine.","The aunt and visitor had identical schedules and both reported no work commitments.","The statement measured only how quickly they walked to the station."]},"advanced-native-646-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The pace of life felt slower because I had fewer appointments and no morning commute.","My usual time pressures were reduced during that holiday week.","I had more unassigned time than in my ordinary working routine.","I did not have to fit a morning commute around my appointments that week."],"options":["The pace of life felt slower because I had fewer appointments and no morning commute.","My usual time pressures were reduced during that holiday week.","I had more unassigned time than in my ordinary working routine.","I did not have to fit a morning commute around my appointments that week."]},"advanced-native-646-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The rural setting alone does not establish the pace of life for someone with those daily responsibilities."],"options":["The account describes the resident choosing a holiday without work or care duties.","The rural setting alone does not establish the pace of life for someone with those daily responsibilities.","The fields confirm that the resident has no urgent commitments."]},"advanced-native-646-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["A place is labelled rural, without asking about anyone’s routine."],"options":["A speaker explains how travel and work affect their felt time pressure.","A place is labelled rural, without asking about anyone’s routine.","Someone compares the number and timing of daily commitments."]},"advanced-native-646-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["That was the pace of life during my holiday; I would ask about her routine before describing her working year."],"options":["The quiet view confirms that she has no time pressure from either job.","That was the pace of life during my holiday; I would ask about her routine before describing her working year.","Yes, my week off is a complete record of how her two jobs fit through the year."]},"advanced-native-646-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Show the changed pace of life through a breakfast she can sit down to eat and a call she no longer has to cut short. The shared duties can remain visible, so the slower rhythm does not imply that her family’s needs have disappeared.","The pace of life changes when the work is shared, not simply when she walks more slowly. I would let the breakfast and the unhurried call carry that contrast while keeping the remaining responsibilities in the scene."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-647', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-647-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Repeated adjustments showed responsiveness, with people meeting and carrying out repairs."],"options":["The community stopped making changes after the first event.","The first revision had already been accepted as the final layout, with no further changes planned.","Repeated adjustments showed responsiveness, with people meeting and carrying out repairs.","The repairs were completed before any meetings, and later events made no difference to the layout."]},"advanced-native-647-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["Different activities led to connected changes rather than one fixed design remaining untouched.","The comparison captured a process of response sustained by residents’ meetings and work.","The spaces changed as people learned what the seasonal gatherings required.","It seemed like a living organism because people kept responding to events and adjusting the shared spaces."],"options":["Different activities led to connected changes rather than one fixed design remaining untouched.","The comparison captured a process of response sustained by residents’ meetings and work.","The spaces changed as people learned what the seasonal gatherings required.","It seemed like a living organism because people kept responding to events and adjusting the shared spaces."]},"advanced-native-647-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Being like a living organism can describe continued response, not guarantee that this adjustment meets everyone’s needs."],"options":["The account describes a fixed layout that has never responded to feedback.","Being like a living organism can describe continued response, not guarantee that this adjustment meets everyone’s needs.","The comparison confirms that no further discussion of the seating is needed."]},"advanced-native-647-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["The city has one literal mind that knows every resident’s needs."],"options":["The city has one literal mind that knows every resident’s needs.","People’s choices and maintenance may be necessary for the response.","Different parts can interact and respond to change."]},"advanced-native-647-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["It is like a living organism because people keep responding; let us hear those access concerns before settling the layout."],"options":["The latest change is the layout we should keep now; asking about the passage would only reopen a finished decision.","We should return to the original layout simply because it came first, without considering how people use the space now.","It is like a living organism because people keep responding; let us hear those access concerns before settling the layout."]},"advanced-native-647-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["The square changed like a living organism, responding to needs through a market, a temporary classroom and a shared meeting space. Behind each change were people negotiating its use, inviting us to ask whose voices shaped the next version.","Like a living organism, the square adapted, but it did not decide for itself. These three views trace human choices and leave a question for the visitor: who was heard when the space changed?"],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-648', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-648-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Students without a usable ride faced an access barrier, not evidence that they lacked interest."],"options":["All students had refused the training after reading its content.","The venue had tested each student and found them unable to do the work.","The late bus arrived after training and carried every student home.","Students without a usable ride faced an access barrier, not evidence that they lacked interest."]},"advanced-native-648-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["Unlike those with lifts, they did not have a stated way to make the journey work.","The problem was access to that session, not a reported decision to avoid learning.","They were cut off from opportunities there because the last bus left before the session finished.","The transport timetable did not let them stay through the training and still use the bus home."],"options":["Unlike those with lifts, they did not have a stated way to make the journey work.","The problem was access to that session, not a reported decision to avoid learning.","They were cut off from opportunities there because the last bus left before the session finished.","The transport timetable did not let them stay through the training and still use the bus home."]},"advanced-native-648-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The entry rule cuts her off from opportunities there without establishing her ability or her friendships."],"options":["The rejected application confirms that reviewers have examined and dismissed her work.","The rule establishes that she has no friends or support outside the workshop.","The entry rule cuts her off from opportunities there without establishing her ability or her friendships."]},"advanced-native-648-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["The person lacks the ability or desire to take part."],"options":["The person lacks the ability or desire to take part.","The scope of the barrier should be identi