('advanced-native-649', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-649-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["A chosen writing purpose gave meaning, while the small project’s future remained open."],"options":["A chosen writing purpose gave meaning, while the small project’s future remained open.","Ada had already secured a famous publishing contract with a fixed career path.","The phrase reports that she physically moved to another town for the project.","She had stopped valuing writing and agreed to record only because someone required it."]},"advanced-native-649-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The new commitment gave her a meaningful next step rather than a guaranteed destination.","She felt life was moving somewhere because her writing now served a purpose she had chosen.","Recording the neighbours’ stories connected her work with something she valued.","She could name a reason for continuing the writing even without knowing the project’s future."],"options":["The new commitment gave her a meaningful next step rather than a guaranteed destination.","She felt life was moving somewhere because her writing now served a purpose she had chosen.","Recording the neighbours’ stories connected her work with something she valued.","She could name a reason for continuing the writing even without knowing the project’s future."]},"advanced-native-649-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Those changes do not alone show that she feels life is moving somewhere in the sense of purpose."],"options":["Those changes do not alone show that she feels life is moving somewhere in the sense of purpose.","The move establishes that she has found the purpose she says is still unclear.","The account says she chose the new job to pursue an already defined personal goal."]},"advanced-native-649-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["A successful final outcome is already guaranteed."],"options":["The person feels progress towards something valued.","A successful final outcome is already guaranteed.",